> differentiate sin(x^2) with respect to x
  ucas: it(x) = sin(x^2)
  ucas: diff it x
d/dx it = 2x*cos(x^2)
  holds for every real x
  check: matches central differences at 201 points (max relative difference 3e-10)
> find the derivative of sin(x^2)
  ucas: it(x) = sin(x^2)
  ucas: diff it
d/dx it = 2x*cos(x^2)
  holds for every real x
  check: matches central differences at 201 points (max relative difference 3e-10)
